    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d294-a2">

                <pb facs="0823" n="609" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg609"/>


                <head>Mr. Nelson to Mr. Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 21, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir:</hi> Please inform me what is the
                    present legal status of the free zone. Did the action of the Mexican congress at
                    its recent session result in the extension of the zone, and is not further
                    legislation required before the extension becomes a law? An early answer will
                    greatly oblige,</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
